{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/06/18/0000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニウェディング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"し、進撃の巨人が...、じ、じ、じ、じじ実写化ですとーーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごぉぉぉ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エレンミカサアルミンは一体誰が演じるんやろ！？リヴァイ兵長！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬぉーーー！めっちゃ楽しみですなヽ(●＾▽＾●)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巨人に喰われる役でいいから出たいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立体機動やりたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(西野、生駒、桜井)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピリッツ発売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、お休みやったんでいつものごとく家に引きこもってたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピリッツ買いに行かな！と思い日が落ちてから買いにいきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり自分が他のアイドルの方と一緒に撮ってるのが不思議でした...ヽ(●＾▽＾●)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして舞美さん、めっちゃ綺麗でした！緊張しまくりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、話しかけて下さってリラックスできたので、嬉しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影後に誕生日のサプライズもしていただいて、すごい楽しい日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひみなさん見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/06/18/6180220/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どいやさん発売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うさぎのモフィショップ、いと行きたいで候..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●西野さんが将来１戸建てを持つとしたら、どんな家に住みたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザイナーさんと相談したりして、間取りやデザインにこだわりたいで候！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●乃木どこ？の私服でかぶってたキャップはNEWERAですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニューエラじゃ無いんです(T∀T；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニューエラも買いたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●学生の頃、遅刻したことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャリでガシャガシャ急いでました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●俺、福島に住んでるんだけど、東北で行ってみたいこととか知ってることとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬に、りんごが入った露天風呂に入りたいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと仙台に行ってみたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●「なぁちゃん」の発音って、「麻雀」と「母ちゃん」どっち？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この発想すごいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが呼ぶのは「麻雀」の方です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/06/18/6180220/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが頑張れますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}